# Nested copies too. mcp/ is a standalone package with its own npm-managed
# node_modules (84 MB) and its own build output — neither is used by this
# image, which only builds and runs the Next app and the worker. Shipping a
# host build would also mean shipping platform-specific binaries into an
# alpine image.
